{"id":"qb4nh4lxkpmjyadf32xgglrdc","title":"美国国立卫生研究院（NIH）最后33只灵长类动物将于明年移居保护区","originalTitle":"Last remaining NIH-owned chimpanzees will retire to a sanctuary next year","summary":"美国国立卫生研究院（NIH）计划于2024年将最后33只灵长类动物转移至保护区，结束长达十年的伦理审查与政策调整。该转移是2015年启动的灵长类动物使用减少计划的一部分，目前美国仍有约500只灵长类动物在非保护区研究设施中，但NIH已宣布不再新增灵长类动物实验项目。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Science 新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.science.org/content/article/last-remaining-nih-owned-chimpanzees-will-retire-sanctuary-next-year"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T17:12:37.338Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T17:12:37.338Z","category":"drug-therapy","tags":["撤稿更正","NIH"],"score":55,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"David Grimm","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"nih","name":"NIH"},{"slug":"retraction","name":"撤稿与学术不端"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}